* 10K Awards List
*
* Purpose:          Generates the complete awards listing for the 10K race.
*                   Run after results are validated and before the awards ceremony.
*
* Flow:
*   1. OVERHDR.RSM   -- Prints the awards header (Exclude 0 is a no-op; array starts fresh).
*   2. @OVERALL.RSM   -- Lists top N overall winners (male & female) and excludes them.
*   3. AGERES.RSM     -- Lists top N in each age group (overall winners already excluded).
*
* To customize:
*   - Change the first number in each line to adjust how many winners per category.
*   - Add or remove AGERES.RSM lines to change age group brackets.
*
OVERHDR.RSM         10K
* Overall male and female awards (top 3 each)
@OVERALL.RSM 3 FEMALE F 10K
@OVERALL.RSM 3 MALE   M 10K
* Age group awards (top 3 each, overall winners excluded)
AGERES.RSM 3 FEMALE F 1  19 10K
AGERES.RSM 3 MALE   M 1  19 10K
AGERES.RSM 3 FEMALE F 20 29 10K
AGERES.RSM 3 MALE   M 20 29 10K

AGERES.RSM 3 FEMALE F 30 39 10K
AGERES.RSM 3 MALE   M 30 39 10K

AGERES.RSM 3 FEMALE F 40 49 10K
AGERES.RSM 3 MALE   M 40 49 10K
AGERES.RSM 3 FEMALE F 50 59 10K
AGERES.RSM 3 MALE   M 50 59 10K
AGERES.RSM 3 FEMALE F 60 99 10K
AGERES.RSM 3 MALE   M 60 99 10K
FormFeedAtEnd.rsm
